 <h3><u>Sher e Fizza</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya ayyuhal asad..(4)<br> ya ayyuhal asad..ayyuhal asad<br> chale aao, chale aao...</p> 
  <p>chale aao, chale aao...<br> Chale aao, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza<br> Sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza</p> 
  <p>1. Jis ghadi sham e ghariba'n aayi<br> Fizza maida'n mein khadi chillayi<br> abu haris ho kaha' aajao<br> be saharo'n&nbsp; ki madad farmao<br> rann mein hai laashe hussain ibne ali<br> karne aajaye na pamaal shaqi</p> 
  <p>Apne waade ko nibhao aao<br> pehra shabbir ke laashe ka karo<br> Chale aao, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza<br> Sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza</p> 
  <p>2. Ek sada tumko safeena ne jo di<br> tumne aakar waha'n imdaad hai ki<br> wo sahabi e rasool e do sara<br> aur mai to hu'n kaniz e Zahra<br> mera rutba hai juda<br> de rahi hu mai sada<br> aayi shabbir pe ghurbat ki ghadi<br> baaqi bhai hai na beta koi</p> 
  <p>Apne waade ko nibhao aao<br> pehra shabbir ke laashe ka karo<br> Chale aao, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza<br> Sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza</p> 
  <p>3. Mojiza rabb ne jo fizza ko diya<br> Ahed jo teen duao'n ka kiya<br> wasta deke usi waade ka<br> maangi rabb se yehi fizza ne dua<br> abhi rehta abu haris hai jaha'n<br> meri awaaz ye pohcha de waha'n</p> 
  <p>Apne waade ko nibhao aao<br> pehra shabbir ke laashe ka karo<br> Chale aao, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza<br> Sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza</p> 
  <p>4. Waasta tumko rasool e haq ka<br> Waasta tumko Ali ka hai diya<br> wo Ali sher e khuda<br> jinse waada tha kiya<br> usi waade ki qasam<br> jald aao zaigham<br> de rahi hu jo tumhe mai ye sada<br> hukm mujhko hai ye zainab ne diya</p> 
  <p>Apne waade ko nibhao aao<br> pehra shabbir ke laashe ka karo<br> Chale aao, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza<br> Sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza</p> 
  <p>5. Laga akbar ke hai naiza, haye haye<br> teer asghar ne hai khaya, haye haye<br> tukde qasim ka sarapa, haye haye<br> maara abbas ko pyaasa, haye haye<br> hogaye qatl shehenshah e umam<br> hai pareshan bohot ahle haram</p> 
  <p>Apne waade ko nibhao aao<br> pehra shabbir ke laashe ka karo<br> Chale aao, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza<br> Sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza</p> 
  <p>6. Kya sitam kam tha ke sab qatl hue<br> par sitamgaar sitam karte rahe<br> kaate khanjar se hai pyaso'n ke gale<br> ab ye pamaal karenge laashe<br> hadd sitam ki ye rukegi na kabhi<br> hoga parda bhi to pamaal abhi</p> 
  <p>Apne waade ko nibhao aao<br> pehra shabbir ke laashe ka karo<br> Chale aao, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza<br> Sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza</p> 
  <p>7. Waqeya Mesum o Salman ye raavi ne likha<br> aagaya sher wo aur laash pe pehra bhi diya<br> pehra deta raha...<br> pehra deta raha..<br> pehra deta raha ankho'n se raha khoon rawa'n<br> jab talak dafn ko aaye nahi sajjad waha'n<br> karbala jate hai zaer jo muqam e Fizza<br> ab bhi mehsoos waha'n hoti hai Fizza ki sada..</p> 
  <p>Apne waade ko nibhao aao<br> pehra shabbir ke laashe ka karo<br> Chale aao, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza<br> Sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza, sher e fizza<br> chale aao, chale aao...</p> 
